"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/OCA/l10n-japan/issues>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been reported.\n"
"If you spotted it first, help us to smash it by providing a detailed and welcomed\n"
"`feedback <https://github.com/OCA/l10n-japan/issues/new?body=module:%20account_payment_term_cutoff_day%0Aversion:%2020.0%0A%0A**Steps%20to%20reproduce**%0A-%20...%0A%0A**Current%20behavior**%0A%0A**Expected%20behavior**>`_.\n"
"\n"
"Do not contact contributors directly about support or help with technical issues.\n"
"\n"
